        "filing_date": "2026-05-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We intend to continue to expand our manufacturing footprint to further enable local content in the markets we service.",
        "start_character": 52387,
        "end_character": 52505
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001852131-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001852131-26-000017-d23831a1635fa64e",
        "accession_number": "0001852131-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate product testing facilities to conduct functional and reliability testing for both individual components and complete system architectures.",
        "start_character": 33254,
        "end_character": 33403
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001852131-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001852131-26-000017-d23831a1635fa64e",
        "accession_number": "0001852131-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While we outsource the manufacturing for the vast majority of our components, we do own and operate manufacturing facilities on a very limited basis, including a manufacturing facility for our controllers in Brazil and for our eBOS products in California.",
        "start_character": 52506,
        "end_character": 52761
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001852131-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001852131-26-000017-d23831a1635fa64e",
        "accession_number": "0001852131-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of March 31, 2026, we had contract manufacturing arrangements with more than 100 facilities located in 19 countries across five continents.",
        "start_character": 52101,
        "end_character": 52243
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001852131-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001852131-26-000017-d23831a1635fa64e",
        "accession_number": "0001852131-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For example, in September 2025 we announced the launch of NX PowerMerge™ trunk connector, a next generation DC power component designed to streamline electrical balance of systems (eBOS) installation and boost long-term reliability.",
        "start_character": 21875,
        "end_character": 22107
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001852131-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001852131-26-000017-d23831a1635fa64e",
        "accession_number": "0001852131-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "From time to time, we compete indirectly with manufacturers of fixed-tilt systems in certain emerging markets.",
        "start_character": 56949,
        "end_character": 57059
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001852131-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001852131-26-000017-d23831a1635fa64e",
        "accession_number": "0001852131-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In May 2025, we announced the acquisition of U.S.-based Bentek Corporation (\"Bentek\"), an industry pioneer and manufacturer of electrical infrastructure components that collect and transport electricity from solar panels to the power grid.",
        "start_character": 20899,
        "end_character": 21138
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001852131-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001852131-26-000017-d23831a1635fa64e",
        "accession_number": "0001852131-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we operate Centers for Solar Excellence in the United States, India, and Brazil, which provide real-world environments for the development, testing, and validation of new technologies and system designs.",
